   <property name="text">
    <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;VeryWatchTool is a free, open-source watch face editor for VeryFit smartwatches and other skinned watches from brands such as TOOBUR, VRPEFIT, Yoever, Kisx Compass, Woneligo, and others. Unlike manually editing JSON files, this watch face tool provides a graphical user interface for real-time preview, widgets, and more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This project is licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
